 thrilling and crash-hit Mexico City Grand Prix.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Ethnic Germans in Kazakhstan face legacy of the Soviet Union</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:79241903d448e557b33d31b6e0aceb507147bdc5f76701c4459b3e3e5ffdeb49</id><updated>2026-11-14T06:44:50Z</updated><published>2026-11-01T13:00:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/ethnic-germans-in-kazakhstan-face-legacy-of-the-soviet-union/a-79754048--09fc50df10b6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/ethnic-germans-in-kazakhstan-face-legacy-of-the-soviet-union/a-79754048?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Kazakhstan is struggling to deal with the legacy of the Soviet dictatorship. Some 85 years ago, Stalin deported hundreds of thousands of people: Some 400,000 ethnic Germans living in the USSR were sent to Kazakhstan.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Embarrassing name? How we live with names we don't like</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:be226fd4a0dd8c84970c1cd80d848cadabb8617d5dd3cc68629de4de711a37b4</id><updated>2026-11-14T06:44:50Z</updated><published>2026-10-31T05:27:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/embarrassing-name-how-we-live-with-names-we-don-t-like/a-79724068--afb6ee0b7720.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/embarrassing-name-how-we-live-with-names-we-don-t-like/a-79724068?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">What happens when your name evokes laughter or ridicule? Research points to negative life outcomes, but some people learn to embrace unfortunate names.</summary><category term="Science" /></entry><entry><title>Germany news: Merz hopes for Korean reunification at DMZ</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:1657f82eb8166ac50f7a5c00a85517f6aec531b7520465d7be676377335ac0da</id><updated>2026-11-14T06:44:50Z</updated><published>2026-10-30T14:46:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../.